* A 68020 register pair (mulu.l #n,Dh:Dl, divu.l Dn,Dr:Dq, as gastor68 writes GCC's): registers,
* not a bare address (before: "(d3:d2).l", which gas refused, "syntax error").
* fixed: FIXME
* options: -m2
* expect text: 4c3c2403cccccccd 4c402401
 psect reg_pair,0,0,0,0,0
 mulu.l #$CCCCCCCD,d3:d2
 divu.l d0,d1:d2
 ends
